      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process, immediately before that process starts**. \n\nThe key points are:\n\n- The Hub process itself never holds the API key in its own environment variables\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected only into the child process environment (not the Hub\u0027s)\n- This prevents a compromised Hub process from being able to leak the credential by inspecting its own environment variables\n- The same scoping model applies to the Query agent as well \u2014 it also receives the credential injected into its own environment at spawn",
